    "detailed_description": "Step into the shoes of a helpless father who has to balance completing a series of house chores and babysitting, before his wife gets home. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPLEASE STOP CRYING is a horror game with a design of emulating the stress one may experience when looking out for a baby. Ever considered having kids? Think of this as a demo for what you will have to go through at times. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a fast paced FPS lighthearted horror game where your goals are to complete as many chores as you can before being interrupted by the baby. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete all the chores as quickly as you can to achieve a record time and the honorable title of &quot;DAD OF THE YEAR&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy the crispy 90's era graphics for the best experience.",
